<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Toho Gas Co Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2002; 10 billion yen unsecured due 2007.</p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Furukawa Electric Co Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2003; 20 billion yen unsecured due 2007.</p>
<p>Kansai Paint Co Ltd, 15 billion yen unsecured due 2002.  </p>
<p>Koei Co Ltd, 906.5 million yen unsecured with warrants due 2001.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Nakabayashi Co Ltd, three billion yen unsecured due 2003.</p>
</text>
